{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>No, Non, Not!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'<i>No door can Not be opened with a Non-black key</i>' is a rule-modifying 2D action puzzle game in which the protagonist, who has the power to manipulate the word \u2018<i>Nai</i>(no/non/not)\u2019, adventures through a world created by rule sentences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoned by a goddess, the protagonist is given the ability to manipulate negation and must solve a number of stages in order to rescue the princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/Screenshot.jpg?t=1748233478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist can use the given ability to retrieve the negative word \u2018<i>Nai</i>\u2019 from a rule statement and then add it to other rule statements.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/\u9ed2\u304f\u306a\u3044\u30ab\u30ae\u3067\u958b\u304b\u306a\u3044\u30c9\u30a2\u306f\u306a\u3044___\u30d5\u30ea\u30fc\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u6295\u7a3f\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8_unityroom_-_Google_Chrome_2025_02_17_19_38_20.png?t=1748233478\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/\u9ed2\u304f\u306a\u3044\u30ab\u30ae\u3067\u958b\u304b\u306a\u3044\u30c9\u30a2\u306f\u306a\u3044___\u30d5\u30ea\u30fc\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u6295\u7a3f\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8_unityroom_-_Google_Chrome_2025_02_17_19_38_31.png?t=1748233478\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/\u9ed2\u304f\u306a\u3044\u30ab\u30ae\u3067\u958b\u304b\u306a\u3044\u30c9\u30a2\u306f\u306a\u3044___\u30d5\u30ea\u30fc\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u6295\u7a3f\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8_unityroom_-_Google_Chrome_2025_02_17_19_38_43.png?t=1748233478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contents (Demo version)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 stages + \u03b1</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 endings in total</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537940?t=1748233478","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/a0ace210b341a5a72474c6a9b46a34291dc760cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748233478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/e02fd9f2ce6855a3258624a832d1f6211df811a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748233478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/e02fd9f2ce6855a3258624a832d1f6211df811a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748233478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>No, Non, Not!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'<i>No door can Not be opened with a Non-black key</i>' is a rule-modifying 2D action puzzle game in which the protagonist, who has the power to manipulate the word \u2018<i>Nai</i>(no/non/not)\u2019, adventures through a world created by rule sentences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summoned by a goddess, the protagonist is given the ability to manipulate negation and must solve a number of stages in order to rescue the princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537940/extras/Screenshot.jpg?t=1748233478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist can use the given ability to retrieve the negative word \u2018<i>Nai</i>\u2019 from a rule statement and then add it to other rule statements.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store